<title>USA: Duckwall-ALCO names Mansfield CFO.</title>
<headline>Duckwall-ALCO names Mansfield CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ABILENE, Kan. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duckwall-ALCO Stores Inc, a regional retailer, said Tuesday it named Richard Mansfield vice president and chief financial officer.  </p>
<p>Mansfield's prior business experience includes serving as chief financial officer of Country General Stores, a national chain of 114 specialty farm and ranch stores, Duckwall-ALCO said.</p>
<p>Mansfield replaces Bryan DeCordova, who left to become chief financial officer of Michaels Stores Inc.</p>
<p>Duckwall-ALCO shares closed down 5/8 at 11-7/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
